{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:9f3c73ac8d922f80f01b:6d371b3af44c9820", "cohort": "revision-aero-001", "current_report_sha256": "4e83ddc50dbc451de1396b7fd64c2fca0928c72fc2125e1351c20a3836c3eb74", "issuer_company": "晟田", "issuer_ticker": "4541", "normalized_claim_hash": "6d371b3af44c9820f370b3ed08019e2eb75b6093b5a5bd1e7b71d2acff208bb4", "original_text": "次級來源稱漢翔占晟田2024年營收41%；晟田年報的主要客戶表則匿名列示2024年最大客戶占銷貨淨額42.20%，未確認其身份。晟田年報列有發動機、起落架等航太零組件及波音、空巴機型應用；另有媒體引述公司發言人稱發動機零組件的終端客戶包括波音與空巴。公開資料尚不足以確認這些商用零組件均經漢翔轉供，或兩家OEM均接收發動機與機體零件。", "parent_claim": {"author_batch_id": "author-176", "author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-176.json", "author_batch_sha256": "41bc6e33fadea51dd9aa0c5b45047c6bc27450584d51897416cce8a5f4b6ea97", "author_decision": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "claim_id": "4541:material_named_relationship:bcf536822f52729b", "issuer_company": "晟田", "issuer_ticker": "4541", "normalized_claim_hash": "bcf536822f52729b64ccb533bbc10778ce417f1609d2c80c8ff2e6926b96b0d6", "original_text": "[[漢翔]] — 41% 營收，間接供應[[Boeing]]、[[Airbus]]引擎與機體零組件", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md"}, "parent_claim_id": "4541:material_named_relationship:bcf536822f52729b", "parent_effective_verdict": "PARTIAL", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "  - [[漢翔]] — 41% 營收，間接供應[[Boeing]]、[[Airbus]]引擎與機體零組件", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "4541 - 晟田"}, {"level": 2, "line": 26, "text": "主要客戶及供應商"}, {"level": 3, "line": 27, "text": "主要客戶"}], "line": 29}], "purpose": "Original statement context only; not factual evidence.", "report_sha256": "4e83ddc50dbc451de1396b7fd64c2fca0928c72fc2125e1351c20a3836c3eb74", "requested_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md", "resolved_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4541_晟田.md"}, "proposal_binding": {"input_path": "audit-v5/semantic/candidate-rerun/revision-pilot-001/inventory.jsonl", "input_sha256": "3c2b97edd0947c6b5248833a9147a90c3e14899c6048a85aadbe