{"assessment_date": "2026-10-08", "claim_id": "revision:c4c61fc7665a5f420b45:41ec82d02132d70d", "cohort": "revision-aero-001", "current_report_sha256": "6580142bbe6da8f743c877984de9622d8a37a17cdae8d3b5f71cab8a0590469d", "issuer_company": "駐龍", "issuer_ticker": "4572", "normalized_claim_hash": "41ec82d02132d70db14768e51a44474b2bde2751dbdd7ed88e0d8b878f9677ab", "original_text": "截至111–112年工業發展年鑑所述期間，駐龍等公司透過與Spirit合作承製波音737、767及777等機型的大型機體結構件；航太公會於2018年亦記載駐龍為Spirit、Safran等廠商的製造廠及漢翔主要供應商。現有證據未確認駐龍產品已實際交付或裝用於波音787，也未量化「大量」或確認Safran、漢翔各自對應的全球OEM下游去向。", "parent_claim": {"author_batch_id": "author-176", "author_batch_path": "audit-v5/semantic/author-176.json", "author_batch_sha256": "41bc6e33fadea51dd9aa0c5b45047c6bc27450584d51897416cce8a5f4b6ea97", "author_decision": "PARTIALLY_SUPPORTED", "claim_id": "4572:material_named_relationship:425087302d080000", "issuer_company": "駐龍", "issuer_ticker": "4572", "normalized_claim_hash": "425087302d080000c9c235a2f7e345fe99d05a0e9abb33fc0b0357b002578cf7", "original_text": "產品大量應用於[[Boeing]] 737/777/787 系列客機，透過[[Spirit AeroSystems]] (勢必銳)、[[Safran]]及[[漢翔]]等 Tier 1 廠商間接供應全球航太 OEM。", "report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4572_駐龍.md"}, "parent_claim_id": "4572:material_named_relationship:425087302d080000", "parent_effective_verdict": "PARTIAL", "parent_report_context": {"occurrences": [{"containing_line": "駐龍精密機械 (4572，Drew Loong Precision) 專注於航太機身結構零組件及發動機結構件之板金成型與精密加工製造。公司為[[Boeing]]在台灣僅三家合格供應商之一，持有 Boeing 全製程認證。產品大量應用於[[Boeing]] 737/777/787 系列客機，透過[[Spirit AeroSystems]] (勢必銳)、[[Safran]]及[[漢翔]]等 Tier 1 廠商間接供應全球航太 OEM。2024 年營收結構中航太結構件佔 96%，為 A-Team 4.0 核心成員。近期亦投入[[勇鷹高教機]]零組件生產。", "headings": [{"level": 1, "line": 1, "text": "4572 - 駐龍"}, {"level": 2, "line": 3, "text": "業務簡介"}], "line": 9}], "purpose": "Original statement context only; not factual evidence.", "report_sha256": "6580142bbe6da8f743c877984de9622d8a37a17cdae8d3b5f71cab8a0590469d", "requested_report_path": "Pilot_Reports/Aerospace & Defense/4572_駐龍.md", "resolved_re